title: "Ensemble: make several LLMs work as one team"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Heo Taehyeok"
    alias: "heok0308hth-glitch"
repository-code: "https://github.com/heok0308hth-glitch/ensemble"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-24
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM orchestration
  - Kotlin
  - AI agents
abstract: >-
  Ensemble is a Kotlin library that makes several large language models work as one
  team. A center plans and reviews, a load-aware market dispatches tasks by real
  strengths and live track record, a shared board connects teammates, and a model
  from a different vendor cross-checks every result. A company mode runs multi-hour
  projects with charters, sprints, rubric grading, stand-ups and final QA.
